File headers
------------

Every FilePan source file carries:

    SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-or-later
    Copyright (c) <year> FilePan contributors

Third-party software
--------------------

Third-party libraries, including the native libraries built from source under
third_party/, and bundled assets such as fonts keep their own licenses. They are
listed in app/src/main/assets/licenses/licenses.xml and shown in the app under
About > Licenses.

The table of file types and MIME types is generated from the shared-mime-info
database (https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xdg/shared-mime-info), which is
licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 2 or later.
